BC Sans Font License
====================

BC Sans is the official typeface of the Province of British Columbia.

© Province of British Columbia. All rights reserved.

BC Sans is maintained by Government Communications & Public Engagement (GCPE).
It is not available on Google Fonts or any public font repository.

Permitted use:
- BC Government digital services and websites
- Projects built under contract for the Government of British Columbia
- Prototyping and design work for BC government digital products

Not permitted:
- Distribution as a standalone font product
- Use in non-BC government commercial products without written permission
- Modification of font files

Official download (BC Government employees and contractors):
https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/governments/services-for-government/bc-bid-resources/goods-and-services-catalogue/bc-fonts

Upstream design system:
https://github.com/bcgov/design-system

Contact: designsystem@gov.bc.ca
